Let $\beta > 0$ be the separation bound for $(X,d)$. Let $\xi, \eta \in \mathscr{F}(X)$ with $\xi \neq \eta$. If either $\xi$ or $\eta$ is empty, then Remark~\ref{rem:hausdorff-convention} gives
