\label{prop:induced-sorting}
 Let $(X, \preceq)$ be a partially ordered set, and let $\varphi:\mathscr{P} \to \mathbb{N}$ be a bijection. Then, the function $\varsigma:\mathscr{T}(X) \to \mathscr{S}(X,\preceq)$ defined by 
