    Let $\bm{p}^s\in\mathscr{S}(\mathbb{R},\leq)$ and $\bm{p}^b\in\mathscr{S}(\mathbb{R},\geq)$, let $\bm{q}^s,\bm{q}^b\in\mathscr{T}([0,\infty))$ with $\ell(\bm{q}^s)=\ell(\bm{p}^s)$ and $\ell(\bm{q}^b)=\ell(\bm{p}^b)$, let $\bm{Q}^s=\bm{\Sigma}(\bm{q}^s)$ and $\bm{Q}^b=\bm{\Sigma}(\bm{q}^b)$, and define, for $p\in\mathbb{R}$,
