\begin{thm}\label{thm:permuted-tuple-hausdorff-metric-complete-separable}
    Let $(X,d)$ be a metric space and let $\mathscr{d}_\pi$ be the matching distance of Definition~\ref{defn:permuted-tuple-hausdorff-distance}. Then $(\mathscr{T}^\pi(X),\mathscr{d}_\pi)$ is a metric space. Moreover:
