\begin{defn}[Kernel Space]\label{defn:inner-product-kernel-space}
    Let $X$ be a non-empty set, $(V, \langle \cdot,\cdot\rangle)$ be a real inner product space, and $\varphi : X \to V$ be a weakly linear operator.  Define  $\llangle \cdot, \cdot \rrangle : X_\varphi \times X_\varphi \to \mathbb{R}$ by
     \begin{align*}
