    \end{align*}
    for $x_\varphi, x^\prime_\varphi \in X_\varphi$. Then, we call the pair $(X_\varphi, \llangle \cdot, \cdot \rrangle)$, endowed with the vector-space structure of Theorem~\ref{thm:weak-linear-transport-vector-space-structure}, the kernel space induced by $\varphi$. 
\end{defn}

