\begin{prop}\label{prop:linear-parametrisation-convex}
    Let $\Lambda : \mathpzc{P} \to \mathcal{L}^2([-1,1]; \mathbb{R}^2)$ be the pointwise linear parametrisation operator of Definition~\ref{defn:linear-parametrisation-operator}. Then $\Lambda$ is weakly convex.
