    The depth-restricted step operator $(\bm{m},\bm{c})\mapsto\bm{m}\unlhd\bm{c}$ of Definition~\ref{defn:depth-restricted-step} is jointly Borel measurable on $\mathscr{S}(O,\preceq)\times\mathscr{C}(O)$.
